    "detailed_description": "The cat gets into the tower, where he will have to go through an obstacle course and survive. For one level of passage, he has only 3 lives to collect all the gold and open the portal to the next level. With each level, the coins will be more difficult to get, because some will be hidden from the player's keen eye. The peculiarity of the game is that you will need to test your reaction and speed of action, because one wrong step and the plates under the player will disappear, and some will rise to the skies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA fun and addictive game that will take you through more than one level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n - Nice graphics<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Funny music<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Responsive controls<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Remarkable visual effects<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Many interesting levels",
